cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ERA5 Site Explorer"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/EinggrauMFW/ERA5-Site-Explorer"
url: "https://github.com/EinggrauMFW/ERA5-Site-Explorer"
abstract: >-
  A local web app for wave-energy resource screening: download ERA5 wave data from the Copernicus Climate
  Data Store, and analyse it at any grid node (energy flux, climatology, scatter tables, wave roses, site
  screening, device performance from a power matrix, extreme values). Two data routes, integrated
  parameters and 2D spectra, are kept separate and cross-checked. Numerics are tested on synthetic data
  with known answers; real-data validation is incomplete (see docs/verification.md).
keywords:
  - ERA5
  - wave energy
  - ocean waves
  - Copernicus Climate Data Store
  - resource assessment
authors:
